  "leftDirty": true,
  "answer": "Enter or a press away writes [word](/services) and closes the popover. With only a caret the address is its own words: word[/about](/about). A typed domain gains https. A caret in a link shows the link with Edit, Copy and Remove Link. Meta+B, I and K do nothing. Enter carries a list or quote on, the number going up. The toolbar lights Bulleted List, Numbered List or Quote for the caret's line, and Heading shows the line's name; Bold and Italic stay dark. An emptied block shows its placeholder again and rows follow.",
  "periodNote": "example.test was typed through the press that had no period key until #218. The read shows the period, so it arrived and this stands."
}
